This project derives the following files from the
`zkp_ecc` upstream maintained by Tanuj Khattar et al.:

    src/circuit.rs   (unmodified; from lib/src/circuit.rs in tanujkhattar/zkp_ecc)
    src/sim.rs       (modified; from lib/src/sim.rs in tanujkhattar/zkp_ecc)

These versions include the post-incident hardening that closes the
Trail-of-Bits 2026 attacks (operand aliasing, conditional R/Hmr).

The following file is reused verbatim from the original `zkp_ecc` Zenodo
project:

    src/weierstrass_elliptic_curve.rs  (from lib/src/weierstrass_elliptic_curve.rs)

