Quantum Cat platform release qcat-ecc-random-v2 defines 10,048 random inputs
in 157 full 64-lane batches, new domain-separated sampling identifiers,
per-input union error reports and cost denominator 10,048. The prior
16-lane draft was superseded before scientific execution. These policy and
reporting changes do not alter the upstream public challenge rules.
